# Hugo
public/
resources/_gen/
.hugo_build.lock
hugo_stats.json

# Downloaded tooling
bin/hugo
bin/hugo_extended_*

# Dataset files NEVER committed
# Data lives on Zenodo / ERDA / Hugging Face etc... and is referenced by URL from
# the [[assets]] blocks of each dataset card.
#
# hugo.toml carries the same list in `ignoreFiles`; keep the two in step, or a
# data file will be gitignored but still published into the built site.
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.parquet
*.npy
*.npz
content/datasets/**/*.csv
content/datasets/**/*.jpg
content/datasets/**/*.jpeg
content/datasets/**/*.png
content/datasets/**/*.tif
content/datasets/**/*.tiff

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Claude and other LLMs
CLAUDE.md
